<div class="inchy-product-information">
  {% if product.metafields.custom.pack_size != blank or product.metafields.custom.servings_per_pack != blank %}
    <dl class="inchy-facts">
      {% if product.metafields.custom.pack_size != blank %}<div><dt>PACK SIZE</dt><dd>{{ product.metafields.custom.pack_size | metafield_text }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
      {% if product.metafields.custom.servings_per_pack != blank %}<div><dt>SERVINGS</dt><dd>{{ product.metafields.custom.servings_per_pack | metafield_text }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
    </dl>
  {% endif %}
  <details class="inchy-disclosure"><summary>HOW TO USE</summary><div>{% render 'inchy-directions' %}<a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=how-to-use">Read the usage guide →</a></div></details>
  <details class="inchy-disclosure"><summary>THE RESEARCH</summary><div><p>Protein and certain dietary fibers can stimulate GLP-1 release. Separate laboratory research has investigated sacha inchi peptides and DPP-IV. These findings do not establish a GLP-1 or appetite effect from a serving of INCHY.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=research">Explore the evidence →</a></div></details>
  <details class="inchy-disclosure"><summary>DELIVERY & RETURNS</summary><div>{% if settings.inchy_prelaunch %}<p>Our U.S. launch is coming soon. Delivery options and return conditions will be available before online ordering opens.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=launch">Get launch updates →</a>{% else %}{% if shop.shipping_policy == blank and shop.refund_policy == blank %}<p>Contact us with your delivery destination or returns question.</p>{% endif %}{% render 'inchy-policy-links' %}{% endif %}</div></details>
</div>
